#: ../../../LangRef.md:25779 ../../../LangRef.md:25810
#: ../../../LangRef.md:25840 ../../../LangRef.md:25871
#: ../../../LangRef.md:25901 ../../../LangRef.md:25932
#: ../../../LangRef.md:26053 ../../../LangRef.md:26193
#: ../../../LangRef.md:26221 ../../../LangRef.md:26249
#: ../../../LangRef.md:26279 ../../../LangRef.md:26377
msgid ""
"The first argument and the return value are floating-point numbers of the "
